    {"id":"a2-capb","type":"text","x":480,"y":920,"width":340,"height":66,"strokeColor":"#6b7280","roughness":0,"groupIds":["A2","lane1"],"text":"The page's own second screen, quoted as it is. The flag\nin #/tier?app=true skips its Support SimpleX, which the\napp has just shown. NEW on the page: read that flag, start\nhere, and carry it: the session to checkout, then the order.\nThe app builds the URL, so it can also say which kind of\napp it is - better than guessing from the user agent.","fontSize":9,"fontFamily":2,"index":"a03e","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"lineHeight":1.2222222222222223},
