    {"id":"a6-thens","type":"text","x":2180,"y":666,"width":260,"height":11,"strokeColor":"#6b7280","roughness":0,"groupIds":["A6","lane1"],"text":"shown on your profile","fontSize":8.5,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"center","autoResize":false,"index":"a079","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"lineHeight":1.2941176470588236},
    {"id":"a6-thenn","type":"text","x":2160,"y":708,"width":300,"height":11,"strokeColor":"#9aa1ab","roughness":0,"groupIds":["A6","lane1"],"text":"then BadgesYourBadgeView, unchanged","fontSize":8.5,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"center","autoResize":false,"index":"a07a","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"lineHeight":1.2941176470588236},
    {"id":"a6-capt","type":"text","x":2160,"y":900,"width":300,"height":14,"strokeColor":"#0053d0","roughness":0,"groupIds":["A6","lane1"],"text":"A6.  New screen, and the only new app state","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":2,"index":"a07b","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"lineHeight":1.2727272727272727},
    {"id":"a6-capb","type":"text","x":2160,"y":920,"width":340,"height":66,"strokeColor":"#6b7280","roughness":0,"groupIds":["A6","lane1"],"text":"The deep link lands here, not on Redeem code: a pasted code\nand a QR scanner make no sense when the code arrived by\nlink. It calls the existing apiRedeemBadgeCode and shows its\nfailures as that screen does. Naming: Redeeming code names\nthe mechanism, Badge is being issued names the outcome -\nand the outcome is what the buyer cares about.","fontSize":9,"fontFamily":2,"index":"a07c","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"lineHeight":1.2222222222222223},
